      "side": 1,
      "message": "This went back and forth like 100 times. The original struct was extended and we decided to have a number of bits used in the misc status of the extended struct. gsctool never had a command to read the original version, but the change to extend the struct in Ti50 landed the same day as the last release, but just after it was built.\n\nPersonally. I don\u0027t really like this change and would rather just leave it as is. The existence of a gsctool that can read these stats and a ti50 with the original version will only be built together for a short time until we update ti50. The stats meant to be collected from gsctool  are the new ones anyway. The original four are collected by tpmmanagerd and sent to UMA.",
